## 📦 Installation

{% if ros2_pkg %}### Prerequisites

{% if ros2_package_manager == 'pixi' %}
Install [pixi](https://pixi.sh). The ROS 2 {{ ros_distro }} stack
({{ 'Python 3.10' if ros_distro == 'humble' else 'Python 3.12' }}) is
provisioned from conda-forge (RoboStack) — no Ubuntu or sudo needed.
{% else %}
Install [ROS 2 {{ ros_distro }}](https://docs.ros.org/en/{{ ros_distro }}/Installation.html)
({{ 'Ubuntu 22.04 / Python 3.10' if ros_distro == 'humble' else 'Ubuntu 24.04 / Python 3.12' }}),
then source it in every shell:

```sh
source /opt/ros/{{ ros_distro }}/setup.bash
```
{% endif %}

### Build from source

{% if ros2_package_manager == 'pixi' %}
Everything — ROS and dev tooling — is managed by pixi:

```sh
pixi install                 # create the ROS environment (conda-forge)
pixi run colcon build --symlink-install --packages-select {{ package_name }}
pixi run colcon test --packages-select {{ package_name }}
pixi run colcon test-result --verbose
```
{% else %}
The ROS environment comes from apt; the pure-Python dev tooling
(ruff/pytest/pre-commit) is managed by {{ package_manager }}:

```sh
# Install build tools (once per machine)
sudo apt install python3-colcon-common-extensions python3-rosdep
sudo rosdep init && rosdep update

# Install the dev tooling (ruff, pytest, pre-commit, ...)
{% if package_manager == "uv" %}uv sync
{% elif package_manager == "poetry" %}poetry install
{% endif %}
# Build this package
rosdep install --from-paths . --ignore-src -r -y
colcon build --symlink-install --packages-select {{ package_name }}
source install/setup.bash
```
{% endif %}

### Run

{% if pkg_language == 'python' %}
```sh
ros2 run {{ repo_name }} {{ repo_name }}
```
{% else %}
```sh
ros2 run {{ repo_name }} talker
```
{% endif %}

{% elif micropython_pkg %}The firmware runs on a {{ micropython_port }} MicroPython device; there is
nothing to pip-install. Connect the device over USB and deploy with
[mpremote](https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/reference/mpremote.html):

```sh
# Install the dev tooling (ruff, pytest, basedpyright, mpremote, ...)
{% if package_manager == "uv" %}uv sync
{% elif package_manager == "poetry" %}poetry install
{% else %}pixi install
