### Lint, type-check and test

The project uses {% if task_runner_effective == 'task' %}[Task](https://taskfile.dev){% elif task_runner_effective == 'just' %}[Just](https://just.systems){% elif task_runner_effective == 'poe' %}[poethepoet](https://github.com/nat-n/poethepoet){% elif task_runner_effective == 'make' %}GNU Make{% elif task_runner_effective == 'invoke' %}[pyinvoke](https://www.pyinvoke.org){% elif task_runner_effective == 'duty' %}[duty](https://github.com/pawamoy/duty){% else %}pixi's native tasks{% endif %} to drive the common commands:

```sh
{% if task_runner_effective == 'task' %}task lint           # pre-commit on all files
task type-check     # type checker + static analysis{% if strictness in ['recommended', 'full'] %}
task test           # pytest
task docs           # build the documentation site
task check          # everything above{% endif %}
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'just' %}just lint
just test
just check
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'make' %}make lint
make test
make check
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'poe' %}poe lint
poe test
poe check
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'invoke' %}invoke lint
invoke test
invoke check
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'duty' %}duty lint
duty test
duty check
{% else %}pixi run -e dev lint
pixi run -e dev test
pixi run -e dev check
{% endif %}
```

{% if micropython_pkg %}
For a MicroPython project the same runner also drives the device workflow:

```sh
{% if task_runner_effective == 'task' %}task stubs           # install micropython-{{ micropython_port }}-stubs into typings/
task deploy         # copy firmware/ to the device root and reset it
task run            # run firmware/main.py on the device without copying
task repl           # open a REPL on the connected device
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'just' %}just stubs
just deploy
just run
just repl
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'make' %}make stubs
make deploy
make run
make repl
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'poe' %}poe stubs
poe deploy
poe run
poe repl
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'invoke' %}invoke stubs
invoke deploy
invoke run
invoke repl
{% elif task_runner_effective == 'duty' %}duty stubs
duty deploy
duty run
duty repl
{% else %}pixi run -e dev stubs
pixi run -e dev deploy
pixi run -e dev run
pixi run -e dev repl
{% endif %}
```

